# Task folders live in the private tasks repo, mounted here via a link.
# Both forms are load-bearing: the trailing-slash form matches the Windows
# junction (a directory), the bare form the macOS/Linux symlink (a file).
# See $DEVROOT/tasks/docs/onboarding-a-repo.md
dev/tasks
dev/tasks/
